# User App API Documentationnnn

This document outlines the backend APIs required for the mobile app developer to build the User App. It covers all the functionalities that a normal user can access on the web platform, including Authentication, Browsing (Products, Categories, Events, Shops), and Orders.

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> All endpoints requiring authentication must include the user's JWT token (received on login/register) in the `Cookie` or `Authorization` header, depending on your app's networking library setup.

---

## 1. Authentication & User Profile

### Register User (Email/Password)
- **Endpoint:** `POST https://marketplace.mecity.in/api/v2/user/create-user`
- **Content-Type:** `multipart/form-data`
- **Body Parameters:**
  - `name` (String)
  - `email` (String)
  - `password` (String)
  - `phoneNumber` (Number)
  - `file` (Image/File - Avatar)
  - `role` (String, optional, defaults to "user")
- **Response:** Success message indicating account created and activation email sent.

### Login User (Email)
- **Endpoint:** `POST https://marketplace.mecity.in/api/v2/user/login-user`
- **Content-Type:** `application/json`
- **Body Parameters:**
  ```json
  {
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "role": "user"
  }
  ```
- **Response:** User object and JWT token.

### Send OTP (Mobile Login)
- **Endpoint:** `POST https://marketplace.mecity.in/api/v2/user/send-otp`
- **Content-Type:** `application/json`
- **Body Parameters:**
  ```json
  {
    "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
    "role": "user"
  }
  ```
- **Response:** Success message indicating OTP sent (valid for 5 mins).

### Verify OTP & Login
- **Endpoint:** `POST https://marketplace.mecity.in/api/v2/user/verify-otp`
- **Content-Type:** `application/json`
- **Body Parameters:**
  ```json
  {
    "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
    "otp": "123456",
    "role": "user"
  }
  ```
- **Response:** User object and JWT token.

### Get Logged In User Profile
- **Endpoint:** `GET https://marketplace.mecity.in/api/v2/user/getuser`
- **Headers:** Requires Authentication Token.
- **Response:** User object containing profile details.

### Update Profile Information
- **Endpoint:** `PUT https://marketplace.mecity.in/api/v2/user/update-user-info`
- **Headers:** Requires Authentication Token.
- **Content-Type:** `application/json`
- **Body Parameters:** `email`, `password`, `phoneNumber`, `name`, `location`, etc.

### Logout User
- **Endpoint:** `GET https://marketplace.mecity.in/api/v2/user/logout`
- **Response:** Clears the cookie/session.

